 /* =============================================================================
-   eMedicalls Design System — PocketPills production tokens (source of truth)
-   Visual system adopts PocketPills exactly. Motion/transition tokens are preserved.
-   Architecture: PP primitives → semantic roles → eMedicalls component aliases.
+   eMedicalls design system — entry point.
+   Visual language: PocketPills production (see docs/DESIGN_SYSTEM.md).
+
+   Layers (order matters):
+     tokens      primitives → semantic roles → component tokens → legacy aliases
+     base        reset, document, typography roles, focus
+     motion      keyframes (defined once), skeleton sheen, reveal
+     primitives  Button, IconButton, Card, Chip, Badge, Field, Search, Switch,
+                 SectionHead, List, Empty, AppBar, Progress
+     flow        bottom CTA bars + care-journey status tones
+
+   Screen stylesheets position primitives; they never restate their look.
    ============================================================================= */
