Subject: [PATCH 06/28] Keep a11y sanity checks meaningful against shared
 primitives

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
Claude-Session: https://claude.ai/code/session_01EeZy9GH2UxqxTR8cR1pqgG
---
